  "solution": "**Given Equation: **80 C 16 B 4 A 96 D 4 = ? \n\n**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a45b5b9191c13cd4da310eb8df100becb078c240f4b0e763420ec154fb42a5fd.png] \n\n**Decoding the given information:**\n\n \n \n\n **Symbols**\n **A**\n **B**\n **C**\n **D**\n \n \n\n **Meaning**\n **+**\n **×**\n **-**\n **÷**\n \n \n\n**New Equation: **80 -16 × 4 + 96 ÷ 4 = ?\n\n80 - 16 × 4 + __**96 **____**÷ **____**4**__ = ?\n\n80 - __**16 **____**×**____** 4**__ + 24 = ?\n\n__**80 **__- 64 __**+ 24**__ = ?\n\n__**104 - 6**____**4**__ = ?\n\n? = 40.\n\nHence, the correct answer is ***'Option 4'.***",
